#: 426eeb9404944fa68589da9d680f4bb4
msgid ""
"The initial published version of this Code of Conduct was adapted from the "
"`Contributor Covenant, version 1.4 <https://contributor-covenant.org/version/"
"1/4>`__ and the `Rust Code of Conduct <https://rust-lang.org/policies/code-"
"of-conduct/>`__."
msgstr ""
